                "footer": {
                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© 2016 Daedalic Entertainment GmbH e Mimimi Productions UG (haftungsbeschränkt). Shadow Tactics, o logotipo do Shadow Tactics, o logotipo da Daedalic e o logotipo da Mimimi Productions são marcas comerciais da Daedalic Entertainment GmbH and/or Mimimi Productions UG (haftungsbeschränkt). Todos os direitos reservados.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
